# Claude Code local tooling state (settings, background-agent worktrees) — never project content
.claude/

# Dependencies — never committed. A committed node_modules broke the GitHub Pages
# build: Jekyll renders every .md it finds, and balanced-match/README.md contains
# text Liquid cannot parse, which failed the build for the whole site.
node_modules/

# Names one specific Apps Script project, not something every checkout wants.
.clasp.json

# YouTube auto-comment tool: OAuth secrets and per-run output. Never commit —
# .youtube-token.json posts as the channel owner if it leaks.
claude/youtube/auto-comment/client_secret.json
claude/youtube/auto-comment/.youtube-token.json
claude/youtube/auto-comment/state.json
claude/youtube/auto-comment/posted.csv
claude/youtube/auto-comment/pin-checklist.md

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
